# Keep the dashboard demo image small and free of anything not needed for
# --demo mode (Phase 7). No data/, no .venv, no tests, no notebooks. The
# warehouse/ dbt PROJECT (SQL/YAML/macros) IS needed - see the Fase 13 note
# further down; only its own locally-generated/gitignored pieces are
# excluded.
#
# Fase 13: unlike .gitignore, a bare `dir/` pattern here only matches at
# the CONTEXT ROOT, not at any depth - confirmed by direct inspection of
# a real built image, which still contained src/credlens/**/__pycache__/
# *.pyc despite this file already listing `__pycache__/`/`*.pyc`. Every
# recursive pattern below is now explicitly `**/`-prefixed.
.git/
.github/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
coverage.xml
coverage.json
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Fase 13: never bake a demo bundle that merely happened to exist on the
# BUILD MACHINE's disk (gitignored, so its presence/absence/content is
# purely a function of what a prior local command happened to run) -
# non-deterministic across developers/CI and could contain state from an
# unrelated local experiment. `credlens.dashboard.bootstrap` generates it
# deterministically in-process the first time the running container
# actually needs it (see CREDLENS_DASHBOARD_DEMO_DIR below).
dashboard/demo_data/

data/
# Fase 13: NOT excluded, unlike the initial assumption written here (a real
# ConfigError->PermissionError->FileNotFoundError chain, fixed one at a
# time, proved it wrong) - credlens.dashboard.bootstrap's demo-bundle
# auto-generation runs credlens.warehouse.build.run_build(), a REAL local
# dbt-duckdb build against this project directory, even in --demo mode; it
# never opens an EXTERNAL/live warehouse connection, but it does need its
# own dbt project files (SQL/YAML/macros/seeds/analyses/tests - all
# git-tracked) to run `dbt build` against an ephemeral local DuckDB file
# under data/warehouse/ (already excluded above). Only the locally
# generated/gitignored pieces stay excluded, matching warehouse/'s own
# .gitignore entries.
warehouse/target/
warehouse/dbt_packages/
warehouse/profiles.yml
warehouse/.user.yml
contracts/
config/
# Fase 13: the dashboard's demo-bundle auto-generation calls
# credlens.generation.suite.generate_suite(scale_name="smoke", ...) with
# its default `scenarios=CRN_SCENARIOS` - so it loads not just baseline's
# config but also every CRN_SCENARIOS scenario's own
# config/synthetic/<scenario>.generation.yaml (policy_expansion,
# policy_tightening, macroeconomic_stress, collections_change - see
# credlens.generation.config). Confirmed missing one at a time by real
# ConfigError tracebacks rendered on 7 of the 10 dashboard pages in
# containers built before this fix. Re-including the whole
# `*.generation.yaml` set (not an explicit per-scenario list) so this
# stays correct if EXECUTABLE_SCENARIOS/CRN_SCENARIOS ever gains a
# member; config/synthetic/scenarios/*.blueprint.yaml, schema.yaml and
# README.md are genuinely unused at runtime (confirmed by code reading)
# and stay excluded, as does every other config/ subdirectory (modeling,
# monitoring - unused by the demo path).
!config/synthetic/*.generation.yaml
notebooks/
docs/
reports/
tests/
scripts/

# Only src/credlens is needed, and within it only what the analysis +
# dashboard extras import - but excluding at the file level would be
# fragile, so the Dockerfile COPYs source selectively instead; this
# .dockerignore just keeps the build context itself small.
*.md
!README.md
!dashboard/README.md
